## Development

```sh
make install    # fetch packages
make test       # unit and widget tests
make test-ios   # integration tests on an iPhone simulator
flutter run     # run on a booted simulator or a connected device
```

`make help` lists every target. [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) covers simulators, Android and settings; [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) covers how the code is laid out.
